      "text": "scVI 的输入要求是原始计数数据，模型内部包含归一化过程。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "scVI takes raw count data as input and includes an effective normalization procedure that is integrated into its model."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的矩阵状态是原始整数 UMI 计数，符合 scVI 对原始计数输入的要求。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:matrix_state"]
    },
    {
      "text": "scVI 在批次注释可用时会以批次注释为条件建模，donor 可作为批次键。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "The distribution is conditioned on the batch annotation bn of each cell (if available), as well as two additional, unobserved random variables."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的批次键是 donor，可用于批次整合。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:batch_key"]
    },
    {
      "text": "scVI 支持批次整合和低维表示，但未声称相对其他方法的优越性。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "focusing on batch removal and normalization, dimensionality reduction and clustering, and differential expression"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "论文中的超参数是研究设置，不是通用前提或当前默认值，不能直接当作你的运行参数。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "The hyperparameters were chosen using a small grid search that maximized held-out log likelihood—a common practice for training deep generative models."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
